# Procedure Control File (PCF)
# All comment lines start with a #
#               13-Jun-2000/SS: Script OBS_SAV added
#               20-Jun-2000/SS: Script IGSF_S1D added
#               05-Sep-2000/SS: Script IGSF_D1D added
#               22-Aug-2001/SS: Use script ADDNEQ2 instead of ADDNEQ2T
#               04-Oct-2001/MM: Script ORB_VER added
#               09-Oct-2001/MM: New option directories for GPSAMBAP and GPSQIFAP
#               30-Nov-2001/SS: GCC ADDNEQ2 run (generating small Q1 (Q1N) NQ0) added
#               06-Mar-2002/SS: V_CAMP added
#               13-Mar-2002/MM: SNGDIFC activated (in preparation for Mel-Wuebb)
#               14-Mar-2002/MM: Activate Mel.-Wuebb.-strategy
#               16-Mar-2002/SS: CPU_AR, CPU_WAIT, EXPRESS introduced
#               18-Mar-2002/MM: Completely revised ambiguity resolution implementation
#               30-Mar-2002/SS: Wuebb DCB results
#               28-May-2002/SS: P1C1 implemented
#               22-Jul-2002/SS: RNXSMT executed
#               16-Jan-2003/SS: PARAM1 no longer needed for STDPRE calls
#               27-Jan-2003/SS: COOVEL added
#               05-Feb-2003/SS: RCVTST added
#               06-Feb-2003/SS: CRDCHK added
#               29-Apr-2004/SS: PHA_ONLY added
#               31-Aug-2004/rd: Adapt to the new CPU file
#               04-Apr-2005/ss: BPE_BYE as last process added
#               17-Jul-2006/ss: RAP_BRDC added
#               03-Aug-2007/mm: V_UPD, V_SAV, V_DEL, V_DIS introduced
#               15-Aug-2007/ss: MAUPRP replaced by BASMPR sequence
#               08-Jul-2008/rd: WAIT_BPE added; BASMPR->MAUPRP
#               22-Jul-2008/rd,ps: prepared for reprocessing
#               24-Jul-2008/rd,ps: V_SATCRX for satellite problem file
#               04-Aug-2008/ps: Added comparisons with operational products
#               08-Jan-2009/rd,ps: V_STAINF for satellite problem file
#               23-Sep-2010/ss: AMBVER sequence added
#               06-Oct-2010/ss: QIF_WAIT renamed to ION_WAIT
#               07-Oct-2010/ss: INIT_VMF added
#               02-Mar-2011/ss: Ambiguity resolution revised and extended to GLONASS
#               10-Mar-2011/ss: V_SYSCRX added
#               20-Apr-2011/ss: Switch from IGS05 to IGS08
#               23-Feb-2012/ss: INIT_APL added
#               24-Sep-2012/ss: Completely redesigned final ADDNEQ2 sequence
#               10-Oct-2012/ss: Switch from IGS08 to IGb08
#               17-Oct-2012/dt: Adapt WAIT_BPE (PID 700) to new structure (740->810)
#               24-Oct-2012/ss: SNX_LOOP added
#               02-Nov-2012/ss: COOVEL and CRDMERGE added
#               13-Nov-2012/eo: CONT_ERR added on PID 881
#               11-Jun-2013 SL: IGSF_D1D and V_DEL reactivated
#               27-Jun-2013 SL: POLXTR for final daily IEP file added
#               18-Jul-2013/rd,hb: V_SATINF: SAT_1452->SAT_NONE
#               18-Jul-2013/rd,lp: V_OBSSEL added
#               17-Mar-2015/ss,rd: System-specific ERP/GCC added (see F1I=Individual)
#               04-Jul-2015/lp: Run AMBXTR with CPU LONG
#               26-Jul-2015 RD: Add V_DTSTC: Min. interval between maneuver and pulse
#               20-May-2016/ss/av: Modified due to OSB implementation
#               21-Sep-2016/av: V_PSDINF introduced
#               22-Sep-2016 AV/RD: V_CRDEPO introduced
#               01-Nov-2016 SS: Added BASEST/BAS_RMS baseline verification#
#               02-Feb-2017 AV/RD: Switch to IGS14
#               04-Dec-2017 AV: V_MACMOD and V_BOXWNG introduced
#               07-May-2019 RD: V_LOADNG added (to switch between TU VIenna and GFZ)
#               03-Jun-2019 RD: Separate copy scripts for repro and operational
#               04-Jun-2019 RD: Skip test solutions F1H, F1T, and F1I for repro
#               22-Jul-2019 IS: Add CRDREPCH to compare with last REPRO
#               12-Aug-2019 RD: CONT_ERR for ORB_VER jobs (PID 882..884) added
#               21-Aug-2019 RD: Add V_BLQINF, V_ATLINF, V_MEANPL, V_SUBMOD, V_NUTMOD
#               31-Aug-2019 RD: Add OBSXTR program
#               07-Feb-2020 RD: Switch from FES2004 to FES2014b
#               02-Apr-2020 RD: Jump back in case of MPRXTR problem
